Minik Alanya gezegeni — Locca (2026)

Picture: every tile, building and light is generated in code (main.js) with three.js (MIT).
Post pipeline (post.js): adapted from lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar, styles/lowpoly-island/demo/post.js — MIT License, © 2026 LemoLab.
Style grammar: "Low-poly Isometric Island" from the Lemo-Opuscar library (MIT).
The fox is a low-poly version of Locca's mascot, built in code (makeFox in main.js). The locca logo: Locca's own artwork.

Music & sound: original score (score.py) from events in the picture; foley synthesized.
Samples (CC0): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), Karoryfer Samples / sfzinstruments, Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)
Instrument sample libraries are CC0 1.0: FreePats (freepats.zenvoid.org), Karoryfer Samples (sfzinstruments), Versilian Community Sample Library (VCSL, Versilian Studios).

